⚠️ Error / Problem Faced

A potential setup issue was identified when using:

git init .
git remote add origin ...

If the Colab directory already contained a Git repository or an existing origin remote, Git could report that the repository or remote already existed.

✅ Resolution
Checked the existing repository state before pulling the required source.
Verified the configured remote.
Confirmed that the project files were available locally.
Reviewed the project directory structure to ensure the required files were present.
